<title>USA: Coherent buys stake in Finland company. [CORRECTED 19:21 GMT]</title>
<headline>Coherent buys stake in Finland company. [CORRECTED 19:21 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coherent Inc on Monday said it acquired 80 percent of the outstanding shares of Tutcore OY Ltd of Tampere, Finland.</p>
<p>Coherent, which makes lasers and laser systems (corrects), also acquired an option to purchase the remaining shares sometime in the future.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tutcore specializes in processing of aluminum-free wafers for semiconductor lasers.</p>
